Notices:

  * Most reactions are derived from the Open Reaction Database (ORD), which is
    licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://github.com/open-reaction-database/ord-data).
    Each ORD-derived record keeps its ORD reaction id in source.reaction_id_ord.
  * Multi-step routes from PaRoutes (https://github.com/MolecularAI/PaRoutes)
    come from the benchmark set named in source.benchmark_set.
  * The supplier-quote pricing database is a frozen snapshot derived from
    publicly accessible chemical marketplace and vendor aggregator listings.
    The CC BY-SA 4.0 grant covers the ChemCost compilation (the records,
    labels, and the selection and structure of the database). Individual
    supplier prices are factual listings published by the suppliers; ChemCost
    claims no rights in them.
    It reflects prices at the snapshot date and is not intended as a
    real-time procurement oracle.
  * Predictions made by agents evaluated on this benchmark are not intended
    to drive actual procurement decisions, since the pricing snapshot is
    frozen and excludes regional, regulatory, and bulk-discount factors.

For the full legal text of the CC BY-SA 4.0 license, see

